  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:473px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HicOaxyGry4?si=bLoIz1XFb8bRBQb_\" width=\"473\" height=\"279\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>本模组为（雪傀儡和铁傀儡的）傀儡祭坛在被建造后添加了一段动画，取代了原本枯燥的即时生成。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur-wither-golem-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur 资源包兼容</a>！（作者：Ruseki）</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">兼容</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傀儡生成修复（Golem Spawn Fix）</a>！</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也试试<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋灵生成动画（Wither Spawn Animation）</a>吧！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3af387\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3af387\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgolem-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/eFjWWvNphY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITIIVc1.jpeg\" alt=\"Discord 邀请\" width=\"358\" height=\"98\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/boboMCmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EGs51Y.png\" alt=\"Patreon 链接，支持我\" width=\"360\" height=\"96\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbo_bo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J5FW8zh.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi 链接，用于捐赠\" width=\"366\" height=\"74\"></a></p>",
